# Local dev: copy to `.env`.  This file is gitignored.
#
# Two modes:
#
# (A) Default — use the committed `.sqlx/` offline cache (no live DB needed):
SQLX_OFFLINE=true
#
# (B) When ADDING or CHANGING `sqlx::query!()` macros: temporarily comment
#     out SQLX_OFFLINE above, set DATABASE_URL to an absolute path of the
#     dev DB created by `cargo run --example bootstrap_dev_db`, then run
#     `cargo sqlx prepare` and commit the updated `.sqlx/`.
#
#     A relative path (e.g., `sqlite:./var/prro.dev.db`) does NOT resolve
#     reliably from cargo's compilation cwd — use absolute.
#
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///D:/PRRO_GATE/rust/prro/var/prro.dev.db
